{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/z7CMwmEVxo5SAs6Vd0E56A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:19.512868+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/z7CMwmEVxo5SAs6Vd0E56A","html":"<div><p><span><span>为促进高校之间优秀大学生的交流和互动，给学生提供一个了解生物学、作物学及相关学科的最新前沿动态的机会，河南大学棉花生物育种与综合利用全国重点实验室</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>省部共建作物逆境适应与改良国家重点实验室拟定于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>—8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日之间举办大学生生物学夏令营。本次夏令营计划在全国高校范围内招收生物学、作物学等相关专业的高年级本科生，来校进行集中交流。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 一、申请条件</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    1. </span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    2. </span></span><span><span>学习成绩优良，专业排名靠前。能获得学校推免资格，有科研实践经历者优先。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    3. </span></span><span><span>对植物学、作物学等相关学科有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事研究工作，并有潜在的科学研究能力。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    4. </span></span><span><span>原则上为于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年拟毕业的大学三年级学生（入学年份为</span></span><span><span>2022</span></span><span><span>年）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 二、报名时间及活动时间</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  报名时间：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>31</span></span><span><span>日下午</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  活动时间：活动于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日之间举行，预计报到</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>天，正式活动</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>天，具体日程安排另行通知。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  活动地点：河南大学金明校区，河南省开封市。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 三、报名材料</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    1. </span></span><span><span>本科成绩单和专业排名证明原件各</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（专业排名应有专业总人数、排名第几等信息，需加盖学院或教务处公章）。如因假期无法临时开具相关证明，可提供国家奖学金、国家励志奖学金、原来公示的年级专业成绩等可以证明学习成绩的材料。提交扫描件，原件备查。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    2. </span></span><span><span>身份证件正反面扫描件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    3. </span></span><span><span>学生证首页及注册页扫描件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    4. </span></span><span><span>英语四</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>六级成绩单扫描件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    5. </span></span><span><span>简历</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（控制在两页</span></span><span><span>A4</span></span><span><span>纸张以内，可双面打印）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    6. </span></span><span><span>各类获奖证书扫描件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（根据实际情况提供）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    7. </span></span><span><span>已发表论文首页扫描件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（根据实际情况提供）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 四、报名方式</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  在报名时间内将报名材料打包为一个压缩包发至邮箱</span></span><span><span>tianyanan@henu.edu.cn </span></span><span><span>，邮件主题和报名材料命名为：姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>夏令营。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 五、优先资助条件</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    1. </span></span><span><span>在教育部公布的具有保送研究生资格高校中，排名在本专业前</span></span><span><span>15%</span></span><span><span>的同学；无保送研究生资格高校中，排名在本专业前</span></span><span><span>5%</span></span><span><span>的同学；荣获国家奖学金或国家励志奖学金的同学，全额资助活动期间的住宿费。活动期间的餐费、交通费自理。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    2. </span></span><span><span>其他同学，按</span></span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span>资助活动期间的住宿费。活动期间的餐费、交通费自理。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    3. </span></span><span><span>面向全体营员，择优颁发优秀营员证书及奖励。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    4. </span></span><span><span>资助全体营员活动期间的意外保险。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 六、遴选结果</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  我单位将根据申请者提交的材料，从教育背景、学业水平、科研能力等方面对报名学员进行遴选，将于报名结束</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日内通过邮件或电话通知（未收到通知为未通过遴选者，不再另行通知）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 七、主要活动内容</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>     </span></span></span><span><span>夏令营活动内容由河南大学生物科学国家重点实验室根据实际情况确定，一般包括：</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>    1. </span></span><span><span>河南大学、河南大学生物学科及河南大学国家重点实验室介绍、参观。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>     </span></span><span>2. 2026</span></span><span><span>年招收优秀研究生奖学金政策和硕博连读贯通培养政策宣讲。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>     3. </span></span><span><span>植物学、作物学领域前沿学术报告。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>     4. </span></span><span><span>研究生备考及面试技巧交流。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span> 八、联系方式</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  联系人：田老师，电话：</span></span><span><span>18227587498 </span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>  邮箱：</span></span><span><span>tianyanan@henu.edu.cn </span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span></span><span><span>   </span></span></span><span><span>九、特别提醒</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span></span><span><span>    </span></span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加暑期夏令营资格。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>     2. </span></span><span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生必须遵守河南大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动，并注意安全。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>             </span></span></p><p><span><span> <span>棉花生物育种与综合利用全国重点实验室</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>省部共建作物逆境适应与改良国家重点实验室</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                       </span></span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c1b0b5b7d97f21d685a0e9977183538366673d4b15f1fe85349a45fbbfec941e","textLength":1402,"sourceSha256":"dfcd2b201859f5810d00c39ca83c1e5c14475d34459580849dab19f2404b864b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c66247fa5642dececdcc","title":"2025年河南大学棉花生物育种与综合利用全国重点实验室/省部共建作物逆境适应与改良国家重点实验室关于举办优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:19.512868+00:00"}
